<title>USA: Pac Rim Holding shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Pac Rim Holding shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pac Rim Holding Corp said Thursday that shareholders have overwhelmingly approved the previously-announced merger with Superior National Insurance Group Inc at a special meeting April 8. Consummation of the transaction said the company, is expected to occur within the next week.</p>
<p>Pac Rim is engaged in writing workers' compensation insurance in California, Arizona, Texas, Georgia and Alabama.</p>
